272, 8482-8489. 10.1074/jbc.272.13.8482</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1074/jbc.272.13.8482</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">9079676</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Zaglia T., Milan G., Ruhs A., Franzoso M., Bertaggia E., Pianca N., Carpi A., Carullo P., Pesce P., Sacerdoti D. et al.  (2014). Atrogin-1 deficiency promotes cardiomyopathy and premature death via impaired autophagy. <i>J. Clin. Invest.</i>
